[1m[38;5;231mWhere should the userId used for tracking come from?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mReturned by login (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mKeep the signature; login() returns userId from the (stubbed) auth response and the caller records it.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Parameter to login
     [38;5;246mAdd login(username, password, userId) as asked; caller must supply an ID (self-reported, untrusted).[39m
